			<div class="content" id="post-content-3830459">
									

<p>I can’t be 100% sure but I did give it some thought during the initial brainstorming process. I feel like such a life changing experience like this wouldn’t be so easily forgotten, even if it isn’t explicitly remembered. I believe that SCP-3964-2-A wouldn’t have gotten over her issues completely but there will be that feeling of profound change within her that could become a positive change in her actual life.<br />
